-- GENERATION INSTRUCTIONS (for the AI generating this file):
--
-- 1. Read `ddr/specs/01_tables.json` — only create tables for entries with schema
--    fields (skip globals-only tables).
--
-- 2. For each table:
--    a. Convert table name to lowercase snake_case plural
--    b. Add `id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY` (or UUID if recommended)
--    c. Convert each schema field using the type mapping from
--       reference/schema-translation-guide.md
--    d. Add `created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()`
--    e. Add `updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()`
--    f. Add NOT NULL for fields with "not empty" validation
--    g. Add UNIQUE for fields with "unique value" validation
--    h. Add CHECK constraints for fields with range validation
--
-- 3. Read `ddr/specs/03_relationships.json` — create foreign keys:
--    a. Only for equi-join relationships (operator "=")
--    b. Add ON DELETE CASCADE if relationship has "delete_related"
--    c. Add ON DELETE SET NULL for optional relationships
--    d. Skip inequality/Cartesian joins (these become queries, not constraints)
--
-- 4. Read `ddr/specs/06_value_lists.json` — for custom value lists:
--    a. Create ENUM types for short stable lists
--    b. Create reference tables for user-managed or long lists
--
-- 5. Create indexes for:
--    a. All foreign key columns
--    b. Fields used in FM find operations (check scripts for Enter Find Mode)
--    c. Fields with unique validation
--    d. Common sort fields
--
-- 6. Add comments for:
--    a. Calculated fields that become app logic (note the original calculation)
--    b. Globals-only tables that become application config
--    c. Any non-obvious type conversions
--
-- 7. Order tables by dependency (referenced tables before referencing tables)

